flowchart LR
  Q[Untrusted intent/query] --> P[Strict protocol]
  D[Desired catalog + policy] --> A[Admission]
  P --> E[Pure engine]
  A --> E
  E --> R[Route decision]
  E --> C[Reconcile plan]
  C -. future explicit adapter .-> V[Provider authority]
  V -. future bounded action .-> X[External executor]
  X -. observed evidence .-> O[Status / observation]
  O --> E
  X -. never becomes desired truth .-> D

